WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.070
Mid-game.

2
00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.690
The CPU is working flat
out, running the game.

3
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.810
You tap a key, and your
character jumps at once.

4
00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.310
But the CPU was busy with something else.

5
00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:13.590
So how did it notice
your key straight away?

6
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:18.270
In this mission, you'll see how devices
and programs can send the CPU a signal

7
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.330
that something needs attention.

8
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:25.090
You'll follow the CPU as it fetches,
decodes and executes instructions,

9
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.550
over and over.

10
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.230
And you'll see the point in that loop
where it looks for those signals.

11
00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:34.960
Your mission: explain how the CPU
notices your key press straight away.
